    "effect_type": "path_change",
    "effect_text": "In TorchDevice.mha, the partial-weight index (which heads/rows of the query projection are used for the InfiniGen speculation) is only computed when warmup is False and partial_weight_ratio is not None. Otherwise partial_weight_index stays None (line 325) and is returned as None (line 379), so mha_gen receives p_w_q=None and the KV speculation is silently skipped, running dense attention instead.",
